WEBVTT

00:26:57.900 --> 00:27:01.247
AG: As an icebreaker, they told each other
about their first car.

00:27:01.271 --> 00:27:04.970
Participant 1: It was a little blue Chevy,
and I called her Madame Blueberry.

00:27:04.994 --> 00:27:07.463
Participant 2: My first car
was a Chrysler Cordoba

00:27:07.487 --> 00:27:09.590
with crushed velvet interior.

00:27:09.614 --> 00:27:11.003
(Laughter)

00:27:11.027 --> 00:27:13.383
Participant 2: It was wonderful.

00:27:14.040 --> 00:27:16.135
AG: Then they started
to role-play scenarios

00:27:16.159 --> 00:27:19.897
that were designed to help caregivers
have better conversations with patients.

00:27:19.921 --> 00:27:22.606
(Overlapping indistinct voices)

00:27:22.630 --> 00:27:27.669
Participant 3: And we've invented
a way to record voices and sounds

00:27:27.693 --> 00:27:31.559
that you can recall on this device
and play anytime you want.